    {
      "component_id": "c_019",
      "class": "android.support.v7.widget.AppCompatTextView",
      "text": "1. Be sure that your TV is supported. This app only works with LG webOS TVs. 2. Check that your TV and Android device are in the same Wi-Fi network. 3. Ensure that your TV's 'LG Connect Apps' option is turned on. (Settings -> Network -> LG Connect Apps) If you have verified all above cases, but still have no luck with getting your TV discovered, chances are, that your Wi-Fi hotspot does not have or has disabled SSDP support. In that case you can try using any other device, that can function as a Wi-Fi hotspot and connect both your Android device and TV to it. Nowadays, many smartphones have Wi-Fi hotspot built-in.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "hint": "",
